- Zone: Transition Zone — modest, accessible housing consistent with the zone's utilitarian character
- Type: residential — multi-family apartment building
- Physical description: plain, well-maintained mid-rise construction, functional rather than distinctive
- History: not yet determined
- Units: multi-unit, 60 residential units (expanded)

