- Type: community garden, reclaimed industrial land
- Physical description: raised beds built directly into what used to be a factory loading yard, remnants of old rail track still visible between rows
- History: reclaimed more recently than Sage & Soil, a second-generation urban-ag project in the same zone
- Units: one — volunteer-run, for resident use. Not a commercial supply operation (see St. Claire Farm Collective and The Greenleaf Greenhouse in St_Claire_05_Organizations.md for actual restaurant-supplying agriculture).

